WEBVTT

00:07:28.819 --> 00:07:32.072
that protect and respect the health,

00:07:32.072 --> 00:07:33.115
well-being

00:07:33.115 --> 00:07:35.409
and human rights of Arctic residents.

00:07:37.411 --> 00:07:39.497
These are the gaps we plan to fill.

00:07:40.498 --> 00:07:42.416
Painting a picture of the Arctic

00:07:42.416 --> 00:07:45.961
that we have never
been able to see before,

00:07:45.961 --> 00:07:48.506
and recognizing that ultimately,

00:07:48.506 --> 00:07:51.675
the climate crisis
is a human rights crisis,

00:07:51.675 --> 00:07:54.011
and it’s one that’s already underway.

00:07:55.012 --> 00:07:57.515
But through these actions
that we take now,

00:07:57.515 --> 00:08:00.476
we can greatly reduce future harm